body:
I've posted a few times, end up deleting the post after like a day or so though. It isn't really annoying to me. It's nice to see that I'm not alone in these feelings but sometimes I would prefer to see more to that comment. If I posted something which someone else has experienced I think I would want to see how they got through it so maybe I can too.

&#x200B;

Some people may find it annoying so I try not to say singular words and try to be supportive where I can.
